ta costringe Selva a tornare nella sua città natale e ad abbandonare momentaneamente i suoi pazienti. Lì, dovrà affrontare i suoi genitori, i suoi parenti, la sua discreta notorietà, nonché le voci e i pregiudizi che arrivano da un luogo per cui prova odio e amore con uguale intensità."}]},{"id":56493,"number":6,"name":"The Home of My Sidepiece","plot":"Selva returns to her job with renewed energy and lays out a new therapy directive for Elías and Malena that proves to be more revealing than she could have imagined.","duration":44,"scws_id":207000,"season_id":4332,"created_at":"2024-03-03T08:30:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:39:41.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2024-03-03 09:30:04","images":[{"id":98820,"filename":"0006fff3-bea4-4501-97c1-76079af8968b.webp","type":"cover","lang":null,"imageable_type":"episode","imageable_id":56493,"created_at":"2024-03-03T08:30:05.000000Z","updated_at":"2024-03-03T08:30:05.000000Z","original_url_field":null,"reference":{"base":"images","path":"/images/0006fff3-bea4-4501-97c1-76079af8968b.webp"}}],"translations":[{"id":181937,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":56493,"locale":"it","key":"name","value":"The Home of My Sidepiece"},{"id":181938,"translatable_type":"episode","translatable_id":56493,"locale":"it","key":"plot","value":"Selva returns to her job with renewed energy and lays out a new therapy directive for Elías and Malena that proves to be more revealing than she could have imagined."}]},{"id":56494,"number":7,"name":"L'ultima cena","plot":"Elías e Malena, accompagnati dai loro nuovi partner, si ritrovano inaspettatamente a cena insieme. Proprio quando il piano di Selva sembra avere successo, i toni si inaspriscono e la serata va a rotoli.","duration":45,"scws_id":207001,"season_id":4332,"created_at":"2024-03-03T08:31:03.000000Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T08:39:41.000000Z","quality":"HD","audio_orig":1,"dub_ita":1,"sub_ita":0,"uploaded_at":"2024-03-03 09:31:0